parameters.prompt:
=Review the change in this repository from {{ $('Review Inputs').item.json.base }} to {{ $('Review Inputs').item.json.head }} (merge base {{ $json.mergeBase }}).

Changed files:
{{ $json.files.map(f => '- ' + f.path + ' (' + f.status + ', +' + (f.additions ?? 0) + ' -' + (f.deletions ?? 0) + ')').join('\n') }}

Added lines, as { path: [line numbers in the new version of the file] }. Every review item must sit on one of these lines:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.addedLines) }}

Zero-context patch{{ $json.patchTruncated ? ' (truncated: read the files for the rest)' : '' }}:
{{ $json.patch }}

Delegate the review to your subagents and give each of them the list of changed files. Then merge what they report: remove duplicates, remove anything you cannot confirm by reading the code, and move each finding onto the nearest added line it concerns. Write `body` as the comment a reviewer would post: what is wrong, why it matters, what to change. Set `verdict` to REQUEST_CHANGES when any item is a blocker, APPROVE otherwise. An empty `items` array is a valid answer.

parameters.jsonSchema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "summary": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Two or three sentences: what the change does and its main risk"
    },
    "verdict": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["APPROVE", "REQUEST_CHANGES"]
    },
    "items": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "path": { "type": "string", "description": "File path relative to the repository root" },
          "line": { "type": "integer", "description": "Line number in the new version of the file; must be an added line" },
          "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["bug", "security", "performance", "sql", "convention", "test"] },
          "severity": { "type": "string", "enum": ["blocker", "major", "minor", "nit"] },
          "body": { "type": "string", "description": "The review comment: what is wrong and what to change" }
        },
        "required": ["path", "line", "type", "severity", "body"]
      }
    }
  },
  "required": ["summary", "verdict", "items"]
}
